window.__code__["loop-gate-py-40"] = {"code_id": "loop-gate-py-40", "kind": "src", "title": "loop_gate.py:40", "source_path": "QwenPaw-main/src/qwenpaw/loop/gates/loop_gate.py", "highlight_line": 40, "code_html": "<div class=\"code-body\">\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"c-no\">1</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"c-no\">2</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;LoopGate — generic session-safe base <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> stateful gates.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"c-no\">3</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"c-no\">4</span><span class=\"c-src\">Hierarchy:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"5\"><span class=\"c-no\">5</span><span class=\"c-src\">    StopGate (ABC)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"6\"><span class=\"c-no\">6</span><span class=\"c-src\">     └── LoopGate (ABC)  ← session isolation only</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"7\"><span class=\"c-no\">7</span><span class=\"c-src\">          ├── FileLoopGate ← file state + iterations</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"8\"><span class=\"c-no\">8</span><span class=\"c-src\">          │    ├── RalphGate, UltraworkGate, ...</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"9\"><span class=\"c-no\">9</span><span class=\"c-src\">          ├── IterationGate</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"10\"><span class=\"c-no\">10</span><span class=\"c-src\">          ├── BudgetGate</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"11\"><span class=\"c-no\">11</span><span class=\"c-src\">          ├── DoomLoopGate</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"12\"><span class=\"c-no\">12</span><span class=\"c-src\">          └── MissionGate</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"13\"><span class=\"c-no\">13</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"c-no\">14</span><span class=\"c-src\">LoopGate handles:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"15\"><span class=\"c-no\">15</span><span class=\"c-src\">    - per-session state isolation via ``_sessions`` dict</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"16\"><span class=\"c-no\">16</span><span class=\"c-src\">    - ``activate()`` / ``deactivate()`` lifecycle</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"17\"><span class=\"c-no\">17</span><span class=\"c-src\">    - session ID retrieval <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> context var</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"18\"><span class=\"c-no\">18</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"19\"><span class=\"c-no\">19</span><span class=\"c-src\">Subclasses MUST still implement ``name``, ``check()``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"20\"><span class=\"c-no\">20</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"21\"><span class=\"c-no\">21</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> __future__ <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> annotations</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"c-no\">22</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"23\"><span class=\"c-no\">23</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> logging</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"24\"><span class=\"c-no\">24</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> typing <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Any, Optional</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"25\"><span class=\"c-no\">25</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"26\"><span class=\"c-no\">26</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> .base <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> StopGate</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"27\"><span class=\"c-no\">27</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"28\"><span class=\"c-no\">28</span><span class=\"c-src\">logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"29\"><span class=\"c-no\">29</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"30\"><span class=\"c-no\">30</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"31\"><span class=\"c-no\">31</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _session_id() -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"32\"><span class=\"c-no\">32</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Get current session id from context var.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"33\"><span class=\"c-no\">33</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ...app.agent_context <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> (</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"34\"><span class=\"c-no\">34</span><span class=\"c-src\">        get_current_session_id,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"35\"><span class=\"c-no\">35</span><span class=\"c-src\">    )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"c-no\">36</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"37\"><span class=\"c-no\">37</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> get_current_session_id() <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;default&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"38\"><span class=\"c-no\">38</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"39\"><span class=\"c-no\">39</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"40\"><span class=\"c-no\">40</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> LoopGate(StopGate):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"41\"><span class=\"c-no\">41</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Session-safe abstract base <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> all stateful gates.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"42\"><span class=\"c-no\">42</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"43\"><span class=\"c-no\">43</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Manages ``_sessions: dict[str, Any]`` keyed by</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"44\"><span class=\"c-no\">44</span><span class=\"c-src\">    session ID.  Subclasses store arbitrary per-session</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"45\"><span class=\"c-no\">45</span><span class=\"c-src\">    state objects via ``activate(state)`` <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> retrieve</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"46\"><span class=\"c-no\">46</span><span class=\"c-src\">    them via ``_state()``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"47\"><span class=\"c-no\">47</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"48\"><span class=\"c-no\">48</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"49\"><span class=\"c-no\">49</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __init__(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"50\"><span class=\"c-no\">50</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._sessions: dict[str, Any] = {}</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"51\"><span class=\"c-no\">51</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"52\"><span class=\"c-no\">52</span><span class=\"c-src\">    @staticmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"53\"><span class=\"c-no\">53</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _session_id() -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"54\"><span class=\"c-no\">54</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Return current session ID.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"55\"><span class=\"c-no\">55</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> _session_id()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"56\"><span class=\"c-no\">56</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"57\"><span class=\"c-no\">57</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _state(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; Optional[Any]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"58\"><span class=\"c-no\">58</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Return per-session state or None.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"59\"><span class=\"c-no\">59</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._sessions.get(_session_id())</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"60\"><span class=\"c-no\">60</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"61\"><span class=\"c-no\">61</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> activate(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"62\"><span class=\"c-no\">62</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"63\"><span class=\"c-no\">63</span><span class=\"c-src\">        state: Any = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"64\"><span class=\"c-no\">64</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"65\"><span class=\"c-no\">65</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Activate gate for current session.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"66\"><span class=\"c-no\">66</span><span class=\"c-src\">        sid = _session_id()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"67\"><span class=\"c-no\">67</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._sessions[sid] = state</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"68\"><span class=\"c-no\">68</span><span class=\"c-src\">        logger.debug(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"69\"><span class=\"c-no\">69</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;LoopGate &#x27;%s&#x27; activated (session=%s)&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"70\"><span class=\"c-no\">70</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.name,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"71\"><span class=\"c-no\">71</span><span class=\"c-src\">            sid,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"72\"><span class=\"c-no\">72</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"73\"><span class=\"c-no\">73</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"74\"><span class=\"c-no\">74</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> deactivate(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"75\"><span class=\"c-no\">75</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Deactivate gate for current session.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"76\"><span class=\"c-no\">76</span><span class=\"c-src\">        sid = _session_id()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"77\"><span class=\"c-no\">77</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._sessions.pop(sid, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"78\"><span class=\"c-no\">78</span><span class=\"c-src\">        logger.debug(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"79\"><span class=\"c-no\">79</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;LoopGate &#x27;%s&#x27; deactivated (session=%s)&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"80\"><span class=\"c-no\">80</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.name,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"81\"><span class=\"c-no\">81</span><span class=\"c-src\">            sid,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"82\"><span class=\"c-no\">82</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"83\"><span class=\"c-no\">83</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"84\"><span class=\"c-no\">84</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"85\"><span class=\"c-no\">85</span><span class=\"c-src\">__all__ = [<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;LoopGate&quot;</span>]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"86\"><span class=\"c-no\">86</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>", "lines": 86, "explanation": "loop_gate.py 来自 agentscope/QwenPaw 框架源码。结合左侧源码与右侧知识点理解此处设计意图；点「反向链接」可回到引用它的教程章节。", "knowledge_points": [{"title": "Loop 治理（Loop Engineering）", "body": "StopGate 可插拔：DoomLoopGate（死循环）/BudgetGate（超预算）/IterationGate（超迭代）/FileLoopGate（文件循环）/RubricGate（评分不达标）各治一种失控，比单靠 max_iters 精准。"}], "related_docs": ["qwenpaw-改造清单"]};
